 HandleRenames←{
⍝ Takes a path as reported by `git status --short` and returns `(oldPath newPath)`.
⍝ For a rename Git reports "old -> new"; for anything else the two are the same.
     ∧/~b←'->'⍷⍵:⍵ ⍵
     ((0⌈¯2+b⍳1)↑⍵)((2+b⍳1)↓⍵)   ⍝ 0⌈ : without it a path starting with "->" takes from the END
 }
